{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f640595915a2e0b0","name":"Force Whirlwind","source":{"id":"source:reference-f640595915a2e0b0","title":"Force Whirlwind","revision":19138,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:23:26Z","sha256":"81eab613bfaabbd6833dbbcfbb8ea495e98104dbc6ed81740e8c0581eace0f7a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19138","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Force%20Whirlwind&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f640595915a2e0b0","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You call upon ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to surround an enemy in a swirling vortex of Force energy. The whirlwind lifts them about half a meter off the ground, spinning them in the air and buffeting them with Force energy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["[",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Telekinetic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Telekinetic"}]},"]"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Time:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Targets:"]}," One creature or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," within 12 squares, and within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check. "]},"Compare the result of the check to the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},". If the check result equals or exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},", the target is captured within the whirlwind and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Immobilized"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Immobilized"}," until the beginning of your next turn. Any attack rolls or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," the target attempts while within the whirlwind are at a -5 penalty. The target falls ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prone","referenceId":"reference:4d99dff1fb964110"}," when the effect ends. The target also sustains damage at the end of your turn as determined by the results of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DC\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["EFFECT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["15\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The target takes 1d6 points of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," damage.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The target takes 2d6 points of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," damage.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["25\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The target takes 3d6 points of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," damage.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["30\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The target takes 4d6 points of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force"}," damage.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The target adds a size modifier to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"}," for purposes of this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},": Colossal, +50; Gargantuan, +20; Huge, +10; Large, +5; Medium and smaller, +0.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special: "]},"You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to increase the penalty to the target's attack rolls and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," while inside the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Whirlwind"]}," from a -5 penalty to a -10 penalty.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can maintain ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Whirlwind"]}," from round to round, extending the normal duration. Maintaining the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Whirlwind"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},", and you must make a new ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check each round. If you take damage while maintaining ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Whirlwind"]},", you must succeed on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check (DC = 15 + damage taken) to continue maintaining the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Whirlwind"]},". If a target within a ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Whirlwind"]}," is attacked or otherwise damaged or moved down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," by you or one of your allies, the effects of the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Whirlwind"]}," end immediately.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
